From db0b1c114f0c392b8ee9e75a73da82a162bd4371 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: okty111 <okty111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:16:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] Add microSD CSV logger, settings page, per-panel MPPT
 estimate and SSD1322 display

- SdLogger: SDMMC 1-bit (CLK GPIO14, CMD GPIO2, D0 GPIO1), no SPI host needed,
  daily CSV files /fusion/YYYY/YYYY-MM-DD.csv + /fusion/dni.csv,
  browser file list/download/delete at /sd
- /fusion/settings: CMT radio, inverters, MPPT panels, SolarEdge, display, SD
- HoymilesChannels: per-MPPT U/I/P/yield, per-panel estimate for 2 modules
  in series (MIT-5000-8T) split by Vmp or Wp, config in /mppt.json
- FusionDisplay: SSD1322 256x64 on the Fusion v2 SPI display header
  (fast software SPI), 7 pages, BOOT button: short = next, long = auto on/off,
  night sleep; page rendering is Arduino independent (native preview)

Co-authored-by: Perplexity <noreply@perplexity.ai>
